Package: redivis
Title: Interface to the 'Redivis' API
Version: 0.14.0
Authors@R:
    person("Redivis Inc.", email = "support@redivis.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Work with data on 'Redivis' <https://redivis.com> from R.
    Browse and manage datasets, workflows, and tables, run queries, upload
    and download files, and load data as data frames, 'arrow' tables, or
    through a 'DBI' / 'dbplyr' backend.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://apidocs.redivis.com/client-libraries/redivis-r,
    https://github.com/redivis/redivis-r
BugReports: https://github.com/redivis/redivis-r/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
